      "fact": "Article 270: Devolution of Net Tax Proceeds:\n  - Taxes levied and collected by the Union (Income Tax, Corporation Tax, Central GST, Customs) are shared between the Union and the States based on the recommendations of the Finance Commission (Article 280).",
