      "topic": "Accounting Process & Journal",
      "fact": "The amount of balance shown in the passbook or the bank statement must tally with the balance as shown in the cash book. But in practice, these are usually found to be different. Hence, the causes for such difference should be ascertained. If deposits exceed withdrawals the passbook/bank statement shows a credit balance and if withdrawals exceed de",
