      "paper": "PC-9",
      "topic": "Accounting Process & Journal",
      "fact": "However, the tallying of the trial balance is not a conclusive proof of the accuracy of the accounts. It only ensures that all debits and the corresponding credits have been properly recorded in the ledger.",
