      "fact": "Sometimes, it becomes difficult to classify the expenditure into revenue or capital category. In normal usage, the advertising expenditure is termed as revenue expenditure. The heavy expenditure incurred on advertising is likely to benefit the business firm for more than one accounting period. Such revenue expenditures, which are likely to give ben",
